    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loyal dog has been taken by a monstrous evil, and it's time to make him pay.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/3e2445027283e0a596c121484f2b5904.poster.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/3e2445027283e0a596c121484f2b5904.webm?t=1753290832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/3e2445027283e0a596c121484f2b5904.mp4?t=1753290832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rogue Inferno</strong></i> is a grid-based roguelike deckbuilder where strategy and positioning are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Position yourself strategically on the grid to dodge attacks, outmaneuver enemies, and unleash devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/92afa44b06bd1dddbe3b0c49159381e7.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck-Building Meets Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a deck that suits your playstyle! Draw, play, and manage cards each turn to attack, defend, or unleash powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/e946ee9096b65a95d29cc67bf0067fab.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dozens of Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a wide array of enemies, each with unique behaviors and strategies. From slimes that divide to explosive enemies and mutant tribes, every encounter is a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/9745e3348d70037cb35acc75d54860e4.poster.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=489 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/9745e3348d70037cb35acc75d54860e4.webm?t=1753290832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Much More!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loyal dog has been taken by a monstrous evil, and it's time to make him pay.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/3e2445027283e0a596c121484f2b5904.poster.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/3e2445027283e0a596c121484f2b5904.webm?t=1753290832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/3e2445027283e0a596c121484f2b5904.mp4?t=1753290832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rogue Inferno</strong></i> is a grid-based roguelike deckbuilder where strategy and positioning are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Position yourself strategically on the grid to dodge attacks, outmaneuver enemies, and unleash devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/92afa44b06bd1dddbe3b0c49159381e7.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck-Building Meets Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a deck that suits your playstyle! Draw, play, and manage cards each turn to attack, defend, or unleash powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/e946ee9096b65a95d29cc67bf0067fab.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dozens of Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a wide array of enemies, each with unique behaviors and strategies. From slimes that divide to explosive enemies and mutant tribes, every encounter is a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/9745e3348d70037cb35acc75d54860e4.poster.avif?t=1753290832\" width=800 height=489 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203110/extras/9745e3348d70037cb35acc75d54860e4.webm?t=1753290832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Much More!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
